WEBVTT

00:02:44.030 --> 00:02:45.861
So this is where you've been.

00:02:45.899 --> 00:02:47.560
Rokujo?

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:50.660
Kureha was just looking for you.

00:02:56.843 --> 00:02:58.470
This is so strange.

00:02:58.511 --> 00:03:00.741
I never thought that I'd be
in a place like this...

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:02.941
...taking in the scenery
with you, Rokujo...

00:03:03.716 --> 00:03:06.583
You were so small when we lived
in Machida, you know?

00:03:07.654 --> 00:03:09.121
Don't tease me...

00:03:09.155 --> 00:03:11.316
I'm not teasing you.

00:03:14.694 --> 00:03:17.993
Hey, what do they mean
when they say...

00:03:18.031 --> 00:03:19.521
...that we have parts
in our bodies?

00:03:21.668 --> 00:03:24.501
I wonder how they'll take
the parts out of our bodies.

00:03:24.537 --> 00:03:27.995
Just like... them...

00:03:28.041 --> 00:03:31.204
Will you be able to kill
your own friends?

00:03:31.244 --> 00:03:33.439
I can't do that...

00:03:33.479 --> 00:03:35.640
But if we don't do that
sometime, then...

00:03:35.682 --> 00:03:37.843
I know... still...

00:03:39.619 --> 00:03:43.385
Do you remember
about back then?

00:03:43.423 --> 00:03:44.515
What?

00:03:45.825 --> 00:03:51.058
You didn't get angry or cry
when you were picked on,

00:03:51.097 --> 00:03:52.655
but that time was different...

00:04:02.842 --> 00:04:05.367
I won't be using these anymore.

00:04:12.885 --> 00:04:15.410
It's all right if I join in
sometimes, right?

00:04:15.455 --> 00:04:17.650
You're always by yourself,
aren't you?

00:04:30.169 --> 00:04:34.003
You really got mad, you know?

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:35.564
It was because I was happy...

00:04:35.608 --> 00:04:36.632
Huh?

00:04:39.412 --> 00:04:43.610
You never forced me to do anything,
no matter what...

00:04:43.650 --> 00:04:45.550
R-Really?

00:04:45.585 --> 00:04:50.147
I just wanted to see
you smile is all.

00:04:51.758 --> 00:04:54.886
Since then, I...

00:04:59.465 --> 00:05:02.628
By the way,
how's your little brother doing?

00:05:02.669 --> 00:05:04.068
Are things still bad?

00:05:05.338 --> 00:05:07.203
Hiroki might be...

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:09.037
What?

00:05:09.075 --> 00:05:10.872
Including Hiroki,

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:13.037
there were only 12 survivors
from the incident...

00:05:13.079 --> 00:05:17.448
...all men and women our age...

00:05:17.483 --> 00:05:20.043
And we're all symbionts.

00:05:20.086 --> 00:05:21.781
There's no way
this is coincidence.

00:05:21.821 --> 00:05:22.810
Rokujo!

00:05:22.855 --> 00:05:27.258
I don't know why we've been made
into symbionts...

00:05:27.293 --> 00:05:30.057
But it might be fate.

00:05:30.096 --> 00:05:31.791
Fate?

00:05:31.831 --> 00:05:33.765
If we hadn't been made
into symbionts,

00:05:33.800 --> 00:05:35.893
we would have been killed.

00:05:37.670 --> 00:05:42.004
It might be that we didn't survive,
but were allowed to live.

00:05:42.041 --> 00:05:44.202
That's why I...

00:05:44.243 --> 00:05:48.009
It'll be all right... I'm sure that your
little brother will get better!

00:05:48.047 --> 00:05:51.414
And besides, a fate like that
can just shove it!

00:05:51.451 --> 00:05:52.816
I believe...

00:05:54.587 --> 00:05:55.918
in the future...

00:05:58.191 --> 00:06:02.127
Shindo, I'm glad...
we met again...

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:05.892
Rokujo...

00:06:16.743 --> 00:06:19.610
Heya! I found you!

00:06:40.066 --> 00:06:42.296
Rokujo, don't come
any closer!

00:06:43.803 --> 00:06:44.792
Shindo.

00:06:46.205 --> 00:06:47.832
Rokujo.

00:06:47.874 --> 00:06:49.535
Shindo...

00:06:49.575 --> 00:06:52.043
I... I...

00:06:52.078 --> 00:06:53.067
I lo...

00:06:57.483 --> 00:06:59.417
Stop!

00:07:01.687 --> 00:07:03.621
Rokujo!

00:07:27.213 --> 00:07:28.475
Big brother?

00:07:28.514 --> 00:07:29.708
What's wrong?

00:07:32.618 --> 00:07:33.710
Big brother!

00:07:46.299 --> 00:07:48.062
It looks like they're serious...

00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:49.863
It's as if they're declaring war
on us.

00:07:49.902 --> 00:07:52.200
But this might be a chance
for us instead.

00:07:52.238 --> 00:07:53.603
What do you mean?

00:07:53.639 --> 00:07:55.368
It will be easier
to search for them...

00:07:55.408 --> 00:07:59.105
...if many appear at once,
rather than one at a time.

00:07:59.145 --> 00:08:00.840
The big ones, that is...

00:08:00.880 --> 00:08:02.074
The big ones?

00:08:02.114 --> 00:08:05.379
At a glance, it appears that the
phantoms are unorganized,

00:08:05.418 --> 00:08:07.113
but they seem to have an order
to them.

00:08:07.153 --> 00:08:08.415
Order?

00:08:08.454 --> 00:08:11.184
It might be better to say
that there are leaders...

00:08:11.224 --> 00:08:13.692
...that lead groups of them.

00:08:13.726 --> 00:08:15.921
In other words, there are a total
of 108 phantoms...

00:08:15.962 --> 00:08:17.486
...that we're pursuing.

00:08:17.530 --> 00:08:20.624
They're divided up
into several different groups.

00:08:20.666 --> 00:08:22.395
And each of them moves...

00:08:22.435 --> 00:08:24.630
...by the orders
of their individual leader.

00:08:26.639 --> 00:08:29.267
In the end, the group that are living
symbiotically with us...

00:08:29.308 --> 00:08:31.367
...might have been the weirdoes.

00:08:31.410 --> 00:08:34.868
So in short, all we need to do
is take out the bosses?

00:08:34.914 --> 00:08:37.075
Pretty much.

00:08:37.116 --> 00:08:38.105
At the very least,

00:08:38.150 --> 00:08:41.210
we might be able to contain
the rate of the collapse.

00:08:41.254 --> 00:08:43.154
Um, Ryouko?

00:08:43.189 --> 00:08:44.190
Yes?

00:08:44.190 --> 00:08:44.657
Yes?
If there are guys in those groups
that might be our allies, then...

00:08:44.657 --> 00:08:48.593
If there are guys in those groups
that might be our allies, then...

00:08:48.628 --> 00:08:49.720
It's no use.

00:08:49.762 --> 00:08:51.320
There are certainly those
who advocate...

00:08:51.364 --> 00:08:52.763
...living in harmony
with the phantoms...

00:08:52.798 --> 00:08:54.629
...just as you're suggesting.

00:08:54.667 --> 00:08:58.364
And there are some that smiled
as they drew close to us...

00:08:58.404 --> 00:08:59.393
But...

00:08:59.438 --> 00:09:00.700
Chomp!

00:09:02.174 --> 00:09:07.510
Don't forget that they are demons
that live in the darkness...

00:09:07.547 --> 00:09:11.210
That's what I'm telling you!
We're shorthanded!

00:09:11.250 --> 00:09:12.376
What is the meaning of this?

00:09:12.418 --> 00:09:14.511
Please explain it to me
in a way that will convince me!

00:09:14.554 --> 00:09:16.078
What's going on?

00:09:16.122 --> 00:09:19.091
He got pulled out just when we need
all the help we can get...

00:09:19.125 --> 00:09:20.524
I mean...

00:09:20.560 --> 00:09:21.959
True enough...

00:09:21.994 --> 00:09:23.427
He's so lucky.

00:09:23.462 --> 00:09:26.522
He gets away with not having
to collect the corpses...

00:09:26.566 --> 00:09:29.399
In any case, I'd like to talk
to the police chief about this...

00:09:29.435 --> 00:09:30.493
Hello?

00:09:31.404 --> 00:09:34.601
Damn it, what is with that?
Hmph.

00:09:34.640 --> 00:09:36.107
Hey, we're heading out!

00:09:36.142 --> 00:09:37.302
This time we're going
to Center Town!

00:09:37.343 --> 00:09:38.503
Yes, sir!

00:09:38.544 --> 00:09:40.307
Oh, you can stay.

00:09:40.346 --> 00:09:43.008
After all, you're our special guest
from the second division...

00:09:43.049 --> 00:09:44.141
You can't...

00:09:44.183 --> 00:09:45.377
See ya, Mister VIP!

00:09:45.418 --> 00:09:47.511
We're counting on you
to hold down the fort!

00:09:47.553 --> 00:09:50.283
H-Hey, not you guys, too...

00:09:53.025 --> 00:09:54.549
Jeez...

00:09:56.796 --> 00:09:58.764
Sergeant Shindo,
there's someone to see you.

00:09:58.798 --> 00:10:01.528
Someone to see me?

00:10:05.338 --> 00:10:06.327
Yukino?

00:10:06.372 --> 00:10:08.840
Hello, Ranmaru...

00:10:09.875 --> 00:10:12.503
I made these myself...

00:10:12.545 --> 00:10:14.479
Oh, t-thank you...

00:10:15.381 --> 00:10:17.474
They said that you've been
transferred?

00:10:17.516 --> 00:10:21.350
Y-Yeah, even though nothing
has really changed.

00:10:21.387 --> 00:10:23.912
I'm so glad that you seem
to be well.

00:10:23.956 --> 00:10:27.983
In truth, Saya said that I just had
to come and see you.

00:10:28.027 --> 00:10:29.016
Saya did?

00:10:29.061 --> 00:10:31.825
Saya was a little worried...

00:10:31.864 --> 00:10:34.424
...because you've been acting
a little strange recently.

00:10:34.467 --> 00:10:36.765
Your work is pretty difficult,
isn't it?

00:10:36.802 --> 00:10:41.762
W-Well, yeah... but things have to be
tougher for you than me, Yukino.

00:10:41.807 --> 00:10:44.037
I'm all right.

00:10:44.076 --> 00:10:45.976
Besides, I quit working
at the crime lab.

00:10:47.046 --> 00:10:50.345
It doesn't really seem
like I can work there anymore...

00:10:50.383 --> 00:10:52.442
I've gone back to the university.

00:10:52.485 --> 00:10:56.717
So I wanted to give this to you,
Ranmaru...

00:10:58.791 --> 00:11:00.281
This is the book from before.

00:11:00.326 --> 00:11:02.123
It's actually illegal,

00:11:02.161 --> 00:11:04.288
but after the incident,
I quietly slipped it out...

00:11:04.330 --> 00:11:09.267
I thought that it might be useful to you
in your work, Ranmaru.

00:11:09.301 --> 00:11:11.269
And...

00:11:11.303 --> 00:11:15.797
Ranmaru, I wanted to talk to you
about this sooner, but...

00:11:15.841 --> 00:11:16.830
Hmm?

00:11:16.876 --> 00:11:18.173
Look at this...

00:11:19.345 --> 00:11:21.142
Where did you get this?

00:11:21.180 --> 00:11:23.546
This is something that my father
brought back with him...

00:11:23.582 --> 00:11:26.210
...after he went
on an archaeological excavation...

00:11:26.252 --> 00:11:27.913
...in southern Italy
while he was in college.

00:11:27.953 --> 00:11:28.942
What?

00:11:28.988 --> 00:11:32.116
At first he thought it was a fragment
of a pot or something...

00:11:32.858 --> 00:11:35.053
...but we came to understand
as we examined it...

00:11:35.094 --> 00:11:38.825
...that it was one of the 108
fragments of the Box of Druj!

00:11:40.433 --> 00:11:43.300
The Box of Druj was also known
as the Devil's Box,

00:11:43.335 --> 00:11:46.031
what would open the gate
to the dark world...

00:11:46.072 --> 00:11:48.836
Why my father brought
something like that back...

00:11:48.874 --> 00:11:50.967
And it was right after that...

00:11:51.010 --> 00:11:53.535
...when the incident
in Machida happened!

00:11:54.380 --> 00:11:57.372
Actually, just a short while
before the incident...

00:11:57.416 --> 00:11:59.543
...when my father was away,
someone broke into our house...

00:11:59.585 --> 00:12:01.416
...and stole the fragment.

00:12:01.454 --> 00:12:03.945
My mother just happened
to be home then, and...

00:12:06.525 --> 00:12:09.187
Ranmaru... it might be...

00:12:09.228 --> 00:12:11.924
...that my father bringing
that fragment home with him...

00:12:11.964 --> 00:12:14.762
...is what caused
this chain of events...

00:12:14.800 --> 00:12:15.926
And I...

00:12:24.009 --> 00:12:24.643
Machida Police Department

00:12:24.643 --> 00:12:26.712
Machida Police Department
Hello, is this
the Machida Precinct?

00:12:26.712 --> 00:12:28.942
Machida Police Department
This is Shindo, from the second
division of the Shibuya S.M.I.F.

00:12:30.950 --> 00:12:33.680
Jeez, the only thing that's the same
from the old days...

00:12:33.719 --> 00:12:35.050
...are the evidence books...

00:12:36.522 --> 00:12:37.056
Machida Apartment Complex Murder
Investigation Evidence

00:12:37.056 --> 00:12:37.723
Machida Apartment Complex Murder
Investigation Evidence
But...

00:12:37.723 --> 00:12:38.451
But...

00:12:38.491 --> 00:12:40.982
This isn't it...

00:12:41.026 --> 00:12:43.295
Shiraishi Home Robbery
and Murder Investigation Evidence
Is this it?

00:12:43.295 --> 00:12:43.989
Is this it?

00:12:44.029 --> 00:12:46.964
Huh? What is this?

00:12:51.537 --> 00:12:53.505
Investigation Record
Data Base Search
Um...

00:12:53.539 --> 00:12:57.976
Oh yeah, Director Shiraishi's home
was in Machida, wasn't it?

00:12:58.978 --> 00:13:00.741
All right...
that's enough, let's go.

00:13:01.580 --> 00:13:03.013
No matches found

00:13:04.116 --> 00:13:07.085
You're certainly enthusiastic.
What are you looking up?

00:13:07.119 --> 00:13:08.313
Mr. Muramasa!

00:13:08.354 --> 00:13:09.514
Good timing!

00:13:09.555 --> 00:13:12.251
The incident
at Director Shiraishi's home?

00:13:12.291 --> 00:13:16.887
Yes... I just need to know
what kind of guy the culprit was.

00:13:16.929 --> 00:13:20.888
He was a drug addict... or at least
that's how it's been reported.

00:13:20.933 --> 00:13:23.766
But he hasn't
been caught yet, right?

00:13:23.803 --> 00:13:25.998
Why are you interested in that?

00:13:26.038 --> 00:13:28.029
I have the feeling that if we can get
a lead on him...

00:13:28.073 --> 00:13:30.041
...we might be able
to understand the truth...

00:13:30.075 --> 00:13:32.100
...behind that chain of events.

00:13:32.144 --> 00:13:34.806
If there was at least a witness...

00:13:35.815 --> 00:13:38.113
Shindo, come with me for a bit...

00:13:40.619 --> 00:13:41.779
This is...

00:13:41.821 --> 00:13:43.812
The person
you've been searching for is here.

00:13:43.856 --> 00:13:44.845
What?

00:13:46.125 --> 00:13:49.458
Damn it, why do I have to do this
by myself?

00:13:49.495 --> 00:13:53.454
I'm sorry, but I can't go with you.
Don't ask why.

00:13:53.499 --> 00:13:56.161
But... he's a cop, too...

00:13:59.572 --> 00:14:00.971
Tarot cards?

00:14:01.006 --> 00:14:04.840
Sorry, but that set
is a card short.

00:14:05.511 --> 00:14:09.447
And so I can't play my game...

00:14:11.050 --> 00:14:13.814
You're Detective Shindo
from the police, right?

00:14:13.853 --> 00:14:15.753
What? Yes...

00:14:15.788 --> 00:14:17.813
Actually, I wanted to ask
about the incident...

00:14:17.857 --> 00:14:20.883
...that happened in Machida
five years ago...

00:14:20.926 --> 00:14:26.193
Machida... do you mean
the many bizarre murders?

00:14:26.232 --> 00:14:28.826
No... the robbery and murder...

00:14:28.868 --> 00:14:32.326
...at the home of Dr. Shiraishi,
former director of the crime lab...

00:14:32.371 --> 00:14:34.339
...which happened
just before that.

00:14:34.373 --> 00:14:36.841
Oh... and?

00:14:36.876 --> 00:14:38.935
I was told that you might have...

00:14:38.978 --> 00:14:41.412
...some vital information
related to that case.

00:14:41.447 --> 00:14:42.675
I see...

00:14:42.715 --> 00:14:44.444
Anything would work.

00:14:44.483 --> 00:14:46.178
Could you please try
to recall something?

00:14:46.218 --> 00:14:48.015
Did you see
who the culprit was?

00:14:48.053 --> 00:14:50.613
Or maybe you were at the scene
of the crime.

00:14:50.656 --> 00:14:54.558
Shindo, are you used
to your job?

00:14:54.593 --> 00:14:56.857
Kind of...

00:14:56.896 --> 00:14:58.158
It's tough, isn't it?

00:14:58.197 --> 00:15:00.392
Your job is life threatening,

00:15:00.432 --> 00:15:03.697
and yet the world doesn't
acknowledge you.

00:15:03.736 --> 00:15:07.331
How many phantoms
you taken out?

00:15:08.340 --> 00:15:10.638
Director Shiraishi, eh?

00:15:10.676 --> 00:15:13.270
He was a very useful man,
but I never thought...

00:15:13.312 --> 00:15:17.646
...that he would try to become
a phantom himself.

00:15:17.683 --> 00:15:22.313
I just don't understand the things
that people do.

00:15:22.354 --> 00:15:27.314
It might have been... his trying to get
revenge for his wife's murder.

00:15:27.359 --> 00:15:28.826
Who in the world are you?

00:15:28.861 --> 00:15:31.329
I believe I said this before,

00:15:31.363 --> 00:15:34.821
but I'm in a position
to know everything.

00:15:34.867 --> 00:15:36.357
It can't be...

00:15:36.402 --> 00:15:38.427
You're the guy who called me
a while back?

00:15:38.470 --> 00:15:41.530
In any case,
I'm sorry about before...

00:15:41.573 --> 00:15:43.268
It was a little aggressive,

00:15:43.309 --> 00:15:46.107
but I needed your help,
no matter what.

00:15:46.145 --> 00:15:49.546
Why you! So you really are
on the monsters' side!

00:15:49.581 --> 00:15:52.778
And as always,
you don't know anything.

00:15:52.818 --> 00:15:53.807
What!?

00:15:53.852 --> 00:15:58.312
You're special... you're different
from the other symbionts.

00:15:58.357 --> 00:16:01.224
That's why I summoned you.

00:16:01.961 --> 00:16:04.930
You need
to understand us deeply...

00:16:04.964 --> 00:16:07.728
Once you do, then everything
will become clear.

00:16:07.766 --> 00:16:09.290
Don't mess with me.

00:16:09.335 --> 00:16:12.236
I'm not going to let you guys do
whatever you want anymore!

00:16:12.271 --> 00:16:15.240
Don't you want to know
who you really are?

00:16:15.274 --> 00:16:16.298
Shut up!

00:16:30.756 --> 00:16:32.348
Damn it...

00:16:33.359 --> 00:16:35.350
Where... is this?

00:16:46.171 --> 00:16:47.638
He was passed out?

00:16:47.673 --> 00:16:49.641
Right. Just in front
of the office.

00:16:49.675 --> 00:16:52.007
Is he hurt?

00:16:52.044 --> 00:16:53.102
This was around his neck...

00:16:55.114 --> 00:16:56.741
It was them.

00:16:56.782 --> 00:16:57.771
What could this mean?

00:16:57.816 --> 00:17:01.047
Could they be challenging us?

00:17:02.621 --> 00:17:03.679
Shindo.

00:17:16.535 --> 00:17:17.695
It's those eyes...

00:17:18.971 --> 00:17:20.802
Sakura, your sword!

00:17:21.740 --> 00:17:23.105
Quickly!

00:17:24.476 --> 00:17:25.465
Shindo!

00:17:28.781 --> 00:17:31.477
What are you doing!?

00:17:33.552 --> 00:17:34.086
Shindo!

00:17:34.086 --> 00:17:34.920
Sakura, move!
Shindo!

00:17:34.920 --> 00:17:36.353
Sakura, move!

00:17:46.265 --> 00:17:47.289
Rokujo!

00:17:47.332 --> 00:17:48.822
Huh?

00:17:48.867 --> 00:17:50.858
I don't care...
kill me, quick...

00:17:52.337 --> 00:17:53.497
You're the only one who can!

00:17:56.575 --> 00:17:58.475
The one inside of me...

00:17:58.510 --> 00:18:00.501
...is pretty tough...

00:18:05.451 --> 00:18:06.475
Shindo!

00:18:06.518 --> 00:18:08.179
There's no need to worry.

00:18:08.220 --> 00:18:10.450
He's a symbiont,
so a gun won't kill him...

00:18:12.524 --> 00:18:14.549
It's all right, Sakura...

00:18:14.593 --> 00:18:17.391
After one night,
he'll be back to normal...

00:18:17.429 --> 00:18:19.727
But the problem is after that...

00:18:22.434 --> 00:18:24.265
I'll go inside of Shindo.

00:18:24.303 --> 00:18:26.100
That's dangerous.

00:18:26.138 --> 00:18:27.332
If you're not careful, Sakura,

00:18:27.372 --> 00:18:29.966
there's a chance you might
get drawn in too...

00:18:30.742 --> 00:18:33.472
If that happens, kill me...

00:18:33.512 --> 00:18:34.672
Sakura...

00:18:35.581 --> 00:18:40.348
For a while, I've been having
the same dream as Shindo...

00:18:40.385 --> 00:18:43.115
That's why I'm sure...

00:18:43.155 --> 00:18:44.952
Why don't you let her try?

00:18:44.990 --> 00:18:46.924
It might go all right...

00:19:06.011 --> 00:19:07.501
Shindo...

00:19:21.493 --> 00:19:23.654
What a calm face...

00:19:23.695 --> 00:19:24.957
What if she fails?

00:19:24.997 --> 00:19:27.932
She won't die...
she just can't...

00:19:29.568 --> 00:19:30.933
Where is this?

00:19:31.803 --> 00:19:33.327
- Ranmaru.
- What?

00:19:33.372 --> 00:19:38.275
Aren't you tired?
It's all right, you've done well.

00:19:38.310 --> 00:19:39.334
Dad?

00:19:39.978 --> 00:19:41.843
Hurry up and come here...

00:19:41.880 --> 00:19:43.347
Mom...

00:19:43.382 --> 00:19:44.849
Why are you in a place
like this?

00:19:46.218 --> 00:19:48.379
No... I have Saya
to take care of.

00:19:48.420 --> 00:19:50.888
Saya will be here soon, too.

00:19:50.923 --> 00:19:52.151
Relax.

00:19:52.191 --> 00:19:53.488
Mom...

00:19:56.528 --> 00:19:58.655
Shindo, you mustn't go there!

00:20:00.732 --> 00:20:02.222
Shindo!

00:20:07.906 --> 00:20:09.567
Shindo!

00:20:14.346 --> 00:20:15.335
Sakura!

00:20:15.380 --> 00:20:16.404
This is bad!

00:20:17.249 --> 00:20:18.273
Inukai?

00:20:18.317 --> 00:20:19.682
I'm going to go, too.

00:20:26.692 --> 00:20:27.852
Saya...

00:20:31.830 --> 00:20:33.161
Shindo.

00:20:35.767 --> 00:20:37.564
Shindo...

00:20:45.477 --> 00:20:47.638
Big sister... save me...

00:20:49.248 --> 00:20:52.149
No! You're not Hiroki!

00:20:53.385 --> 00:20:56.912
Shindo... Shindo, remember!

00:20:56.955 --> 00:21:01.551
You're the one who told me
that you believe in the future!

00:21:03.161 --> 00:21:04.150
Rokujo...

00:21:09.234 --> 00:21:10.895
Thank goodness...

00:21:14.239 --> 00:21:15.763
Sakura!

00:21:16.408 --> 00:21:17.568
Inukai!

00:21:25.717 --> 00:21:28.151
Inukai, do it stronger!

00:21:35.727 --> 00:21:36.751
Rokujo?

00:21:37.796 --> 00:21:38.820
Rokujo!?

00:22:09.661 --> 00:22:10.719
Ranmaru!

00:22:10.762 --> 00:22:12.195
Shindo!

00:22:16.702 --> 00:22:18.192
Rokujo.

